{"candidateAnswer":"- LGBTQ youth mentorship program  \n- Volunteering at LGBTQ+ youth center  \n- Adoption advice/assistance group  \n- Planning a talent show for kids","evidence":"[D9:2 | 2:31 pm on 17 July, 2023] Caroline: Hey Melanie! That sounds great! Last weekend I joined a mentorship program for LGBTQ youth - it's really rewarding to help the community.\n[D3:3 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Mel! Your backing really means a lot. I felt super powerful giving my talk. I shared my own journey, the struggles I had and how much I've developed since coming out. It was wonderful to see how the audience related to what I said and how it inspired them to be better allies. Conversations about gender identity and inclusion are so necessary and I'm thankful for being able to give a voice to the trans community.","itemId":"urn:uuid:63c9767c-9170-51d1-8a90-40f7e36f5619","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:67da223826f5a530862202a21416288169c01d44b33022d2587a12ccee20bd6a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What events has Caroline participated in to help children?","referenceAnswer":"Mentoring program, school speech","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"67da223826f5a530862202a21416288169c01d44b33022d2587a12ccee20bd6a"}}]}